<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Turing returns about six months after his first visit. His right ankle sprain from August healed within three weeks and he is back to about 40 km a week. He has finished the course of 16 psychotherapy sessions and now sees the psychologist monthly. He feels like himself, sleeps about seven hours, and has been changing at his running club again for a month. He takes bupropion XL 150 mg and cholecalciferol every morning, has missed no doses, and has no side effects. The breast tissue is no longer tender, though he can still feel a small disc on the left. He has had no suicidal thoughts. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Feels like himself; back with his running club</td></tr><tr><td>Ankle</td><td>Sprain healed within three weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Psychotherapy</td><td>Course of 16 sessions finished; monthly sessions now</td></tr><tr><td>Breasts</td><td>No tenderness; small disc on the left</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No suicidal thoughts</td></tr><tr><td>PHQ-9</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

